sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant LC as LeadController
    participant LS as LeadService
    participant LEP as LeadEventPublisher
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
    participant CRCL as ClientResolveCommandListener
    participant CS as ClientService
    participant CREL as ClientResolvedEventListener

    FE->>LC: POST /api/leads (client: cnpj/name/phone)
    LC->>LS: create(request)
    LS->>LS: leadRepository.save(lead)
    LS->>LEP: publishClientResolveCommand(leadId, cnpj, name, phone)
    LEP->>RMQ: convertAndSend("lead.commands", "lead.client.resolve", command)
    LS-->>LC: LeadResponse (sem clientId)
    LC-->>FE: 201 Created

    Note over RMQ: Processamento assíncrono

    RMQ->>CRCL: Deliver LeadClientResolveCommand
    CRCL->>CS: findOrCreate(cnpj, name, phone)
    CS-->>CRCL: ClientResponse (clientId)
    CRCL->>RMQ: convertAndSend("client.events", "client.resolved", event)

    RMQ->>CREL: Deliver ClientResolvedEvent
    CREL->>CREL: leadRepository.findById(leadId)
    CREL->>CREL: lead.setClientId(clientId)
    CREL->>CREL: leadRepository.save(lead)
